# Line endings for this course only, so the rest of the repo is unaffected.
#
# The notebooks and decks are generated by Python scripts in tools/, and
# Python's text mode writes CRLF on Windows. Without this, every rebuild
# would show as a whole-file rewrite. text=auto stores LF and checks out
# whatever the platform uses, so a rebuild only ever diffs what changed.
#
# Binary files are detected and left alone. The exported decks in slides/pdf/
# are tracked, so they say so outright rather than relying on detection: a PDF
# put through CRLF conversion is corrupted, and it fails silently.
* text=auto
*.pdf binary
